Package: datarais
Type: Package
Title: Access Brazilian RAIS Microdata via 'DuckDB'
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Alexsandro", "Prado",
    email = "alexsandroprado@ufersa.edu.br",
    role  = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description:
    Provides access to the microdata of the Brazilian 'Relacao Anual de
    Informacoes Sociais' (RAIS), the annual formal employment census of the
    Ministry of Labour, covering employment records and establishments from
    1985 to 2025. Files are downloaded from the 'HuggingFace' dataset
    <https://huggingface.co/datasets/alexsandroprado/rais>, extracted as a
    stream and loaded into a local 'DuckDB' database for fast queries with
    'SQL' or 'dplyr'. Both the state-based (1985-2017) and the region-based
    (2018 onwards) file layouts are supported, with automatic normalisation
    of variable names. Messages are available in English and Portuguese.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
SystemRequirements: 7-Zip (https://www.7-zip.org/) for
    extracting pre-2020 RAIS files (PPMd compression). Not required
    for 2020+ files (LZMA compression).
